[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":58},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":56,"_13":56,"_38":57},"id","basico-face-amarela","nome","Yellow face","rascunho",false,"html","<p>With the 1st layer done, hold the cube with white on the bottom: the 4 top corners have yellow, but it may be facing the sides. Now the corners twist until the top face is all yellow. A single algorithm solves it: the <strong><a href=\"/en/glossary#sune\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Two short OLL algorithms that orient 3 corners: R U R' U R U2 R' (Sune) and R U2 R' U' R U' R' (Anti-Sune).\">Sune</a></strong>, <code>R U R&#39; U R U2 R&#39;</code>. It&#39;s the same one as in the 3x3 yellow face.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;c2oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4740def75d858104.svg\" alt=\"The goal: the top face all yellow (the sides don't matter yet).\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal: the top face all yellow (the sides don&#39;t matter yet).</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Count the yellow corners</h2>\n<p>Look at the top and count how many corners already have yellow facing up.</p>\n<p><strong>One corner</strong> (the fish): turn the top (<code>U</code>) until that corner is at the <strong>front left</strong>. Do the Sune.</p>\n<p><strong>Zero or two corners</strong>: turn the top until the front-left corner has yellow facing <strong>left</strong>. Do the Sune.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;c2oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7e24724cf88076f0.svg\" alt=\"Fish: the yellow corner at the front left. 1 Sune.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Fish: the yellow corner at the front left. 1 Sune.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;c2oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/b3df000db9cdb0db.svg\" alt=\"Zero: the front-left yellow facing left. 2 Sunes.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Zero: the front-left yellow facing left. 2 Sunes.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R' R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;c2oll&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/49d5d7834e5ecc21.svg\" alt=\"Two: the front-left yellow facing left. 3 Sunes.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Two: the front-left yellow facing left. 3 Sunes.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>After the Sune, look again and repeat the rule. In at most 3 Sunes the face is yellow. The 1st layer breaks in the middle of the algorithm and comes back at the end: don&#39;t stop halfway.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U2 R' U' R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;c2oll&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"R U R' U R U2 R'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-5.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U2</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/26f0fd457ed6fc57-7.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The Sune on the fish.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>To memorize the Sune: start like the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a>, but with <code>U</code> at the end instead of <code>U&#39;</code> (<code>R U R&#39; U</code>), and finish with <code>R U2 R&#39;</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> if at the end a single corner is left with its yellow turned, and the Sune doesn&#39;t fix it, the cube was put together wrong: that corner is twisted. Take the corner out, put it back with yellow up and carry on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n","treino","/2x2/treino?grupo=basico/face-amarela/casos","metodos",[51],"anterior",{"_13":49,"_38":50},"proximo",{"_13":47,"_38":48},"grupos",[29],{"_11":30,"_13":14,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":16,"_36":37,"_38":39},"2x2 Passo 2","nivel","iniciante","casos",7,"conjunto","ids",[40,41,42,43,44,45,46],"endereco","/2x2/basico/face-amarela/casos","2X2-B2-Peixe-Sune","2X2-B2-Peixe-Anti-Sune","2X2-B2-Cruz-H","2X2-B2-Pi","2X2-B2-Farois","2X2-B2-T","2X2-B2-Gravata","Corners in place","/2x2/basico/cantos","1st face","/2x2/primeira-face",{"_13":52,"_53":54,"_38":55},"Beginner method","numero",2,"/2x2/basico#face-amarela","2x2","/2x2/",{"_59":60,"_61":62},"cubos",[65,66,67,68,69,70,71],"idiomas",[63,64],"pt","en",{"_11":80,"_13":80},{"_11":56,"_13":56},{"_11":79,"_13":79},{"_11":78,"_13":78},{"_11":76,"_13":77},{"_11":74,"_13":75},{"_11":72,"_13":73},"skewb","Skewb","pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","3x3"]
